    <dc:creator>admin</dc:creator>
    <excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[The world's first GEO course in Sri Lanka. Learn how to optimise your content for AI-powered search engines like Google AI Overviews, ChatGPT Search, and Perplexity.]]></excerpt:encoded>
    <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Generative Engine Optimization (GEO) is the next frontier of search. As AI tools like Google AI Overviews and ChatGPT Search replace traditional blue links, businesses need a new kind of content strategy to stay visible.</p>
<p>This intensive 4-week course teaches you exactly how to optimise your website and content to appear in AI-generated answers — the skill that will define digital marketing in 2025 and beyond.</p>]]></content:encoded>
