    <excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[A complete 20-week bootcamp covering UI/UX design, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and WordPress — everything you need to build and launch professional websites for clients.]]></excerpt:encoded>
    <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>The Web Design &amp; Development Bootcamp is the most comprehensive web course in Sri Lanka. Over 20 weeks you will go from zero experience to building and deploying full professional websites — covering design principles, HTML &amp; CSS, JavaScript, WordPress, and client management.</p>
